SATCORP HQ SERVER ARCHITECTURE KNOWLEDGE MODEL
Entity: SATCORP HQ Discord Server
Type: Enterprise Operations Network + Public Community Hub
Core Design Philosophy: A combined corporate operations network and public community housed within a single server, split into two primary layers (Community Layer and Operator Layer) using a modular 3D role matrix.
 * STRUCTURAL MODEL & LAYER ARCHITECTURE
 * Community Layer (Public Front End):
   * Purpose: Normal members, creators, testers, players, and supporters interact here without knowledge of the operator infrastructure.
   * Categories & Focus: SATCORP information, KYRAX information, Ki-Ra Studios, Games, PULSE, Announcements, Development updates, Community discussion, Gaming, Creator activities, Testing, Support, Suggestions, Events, and general community engagement.
 * Operator Layer (Operator Back End / Working Environment):
   * Purpose: Working environment for SATCORP personnel to plan, build, coordinate, deploy, monitor, document, manage, and execute.
   * Operational Scope: Engineering, project management, infrastructure, AI/KYRAX management, QA, production, security, partnerships, client services, research, documentation, marketing, business ops, game teams, incident response, deployment reviews, and system monitoring.
   * Principle of Least Privilege: Operators do not automatically gain access to everything; access is restricted by function and ecosystem assignment.
