 * CORE FUNCTIONAL LAYERS & ROLES
 * Command Layer: Decide, authorize, prioritize, resolve incidents, govern the ecosystem.
 * KYRAX Layer: Automate, observe, report, route, assist, integrate systems (acting as the server's central nervous system and automation interface).
 * Cross-Division Flexibility: Operators can support multiple projects/divisions (e.g., an infrastructure operator supporting KYRAX, NAMTAR, RELENTLESS, and SATCORP HQ simultaneously) based on their function and assignment rather than siloed access.
